# ============================================
# PM-Brain .gitignore
# ============================================
#
# PUBLIC MODE is active by default — nothing extra to enable.
# Everything in the repo is tracked except the always-active block below.
#
# To switch modes: tell the PM Brain agent "switch me to private/team/public mode"
#   The agent will uncomment the right block below and list any already-tracked
#   files that might contain sensitive data.
#
# ⚠ IMPORTANT — switching modes after already committing files:
#   .gitignore only gates future untracked files. It does not un-track files
#   already in git history. To un-track a file that was already committed, run:
#     git rm --cached <file>
#     git commit -m "setup: un-track sensitive file"
#   Or ask the agent: "what tracked files might be sensitive in private mode?"
#
# ⚠ BEFORE YOUR FIRST PUSH: verify your GitHub repo visibility is set to Private
#   if you are using private or team mode.
#   Go to: repo Settings → Danger Zone → Change visibility
#
# ============================================

# ============================================
# ALWAYS ACTIVE (all modes)
# ============================================

# Sensitive data (always ignored)
TODO.md
.env
**/secrets.md
**/private-notes.md
**/credentials.json

# OS and editor files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.vscode/settings.json
.idea/

# ============================================
# PRIVATE MODE — uncomment this block to enable
# (or tell the agent "switch me to private mode")
# ============================================

# # --- Personal practice content ---
# 5-Growth/1-daily-log-*.md
# 5-Growth/1-Learning-Log/*/
# 5-Growth/2-Growth-Portfolio/*.md
# !5-Growth/2-Growth-Portfolio/README.md
# 5-Growth/self-assessment-*.md
# 5-Growth/metrics-dashboard*.md
# 5-Growth/3-Product-Judgment-Test/forecast-log.md
# 5-Growth/3-Product-Judgment-Test/dashboard.md
#
# # --- Company-specific content ---
# 1-Context/*.md
# !1-Context/README.md
#
# # --- Personal configuration ---
# USER.md
#
# # --- Active work & research ---
# 3-Work/*
# !3-Work/README.md
# !3-Work/1-Initiative-Codename/
# 4-Research/*
# !4-Research/README.md
# !4-Research/1-User-Interviews/README.md
# !4-Research/2-Qualitative-Research/

# ============================================
# TEAM MODE — uncomment this block to enable
# (or tell the agent "switch me to team mode")
# Note: company naming in USER.md can be shared with team by tracking USER.md
# in team mode (see team block below).
# ============================================

# # --- Personal practice content (each team member keeps theirs private) ---
# 5-Growth/1-daily-log-*.md
# 5-Growth/1-Learning-Log/*/
# 5-Growth/2-Growth-Portfolio/*.md
# !5-Growth/2-Growth-Portfolio/README.md
# 5-Growth/self-assessment-*.md
# 5-Growth/metrics-dashboard*.md
# 5-Growth/3-Product-Judgment-Test/forecast-log.md
# 5-Growth/3-Product-Judgment-Test/dashboard.md
#
# # --- Company-specific content ---
# 1-Context/*.md
# !1-Context/README.md
#
# # --- Active work & research ---
# 3-Work/*
# !3-Work/README.md
# 4-Research/*
# !4-Research/README.md
# # --- Personal configuration (each team member has their own) ---
# USER.md